# FoodSnap AI — environment variables
#
# The app runs in a graceful "demo / mock" mode when no provider is configured,
# so you can try the full flow without any credentials. Add ONE provider's key
# below to enable real AI image analysis.
#
# Provider selection:
#   - Leave AI_PROVIDER unset to auto-detect from whichever key is present
#     (Anthropic is preferred if both are set).
#   - Or set AI_PROVIDER explicitly to "anthropic", "gemini", or "mock".
# AI_PROVIDER=

# --- Option A: Anthropic (Claude) — https://console.anthropic.com/ ---
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the vision model (defaults to the cheapest tier, claude-haiku-4-5-20251001)
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001

# --- Option B: Google Gemini — https://aistudio.google.com/apikey ---
# GEMINI_API_KEY (or GOOGLE_API_KEY) enables the Gemini backend.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the vision model (defaults to the cheapest tier, gemini-2.5-flash-lite)
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash-lite
